They are derived from the ECtHR cases dataset of Chalkidis et al. (2019, 2021),
https://huggingface.co/datasets/AUEB-NLP/ecthr_cases, which is itself licensed
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, so the same license applies under its ShareAlike term. The
NRC emotion scores in data/ were computed with the NRC Emotion Lexicon
(Mohammad and Turney 2013), which is free for research use. The lexicon itself
is not included.

